WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.701
Hooray! We have finally arrived.

2
00:00:05.702 --> 00:00:07.375
Mom: Let’s line up.

3
00:00:07.376 --> 00:00:09.623
Bada: What now,

4
00:00:09.624 --> 00:00:12.421
Mom? Mom: We show our passports to the

5
00:00:12.422 --> 00:00:17.362
man. He will ask some questions. That’s all.

6
00:00:17.363 --> 00:00:20.495
Immigration: Good afternoon! Your passports,

7
00:00:20.496 --> 00:00:21.988
please.Where are you from? Hana:

8
00:00:21.989 --> 00:00:26.752
We are from Korea! Immigration:

9
00:00:26.753 --> 00:00:28.864
How long do you plan to stay? Mom:

10
00:00:28.866 --> 00:00:31.293
We will stay for a month.

11
00:00:31.294 --> 00:00:36.190
Hana: My Aunt Sunny is getting married!

12
00:00:36.191 --> 00:00:38.161
Immigration: How wonderful!

13
00:00:38.162 --> 00:00:40.478
Welcome to the United States. Enjoy

14
00:00:40.479 --> 00:00:42.712
your stay here. Mom:

15
00:00:42.713 --> 00:00:44.553
Thank you. Bada:

16
00:00:44.554 --> 00:00:46.538
THANK YOU! Mom:

17
00:00:46.539 --> 00:00:52.011
Now, we have to pick up our bags. Mom:

18
00:00:52.012 --> 00:00:54.656
Hmm. Excuse me, sir.

19
00:00:54.657 --> 00:00:57.491
Where is the baggage claim area? Officer:

20
00:00:57.492 --> 00:01:00.687
Go straight ahead and turn right. Mom:

21
00:01:00.688 --> 00:01:02.388
Thank you. Officer:

22
00:01:02.389 --> 00:01:06.792
My pleasure, ma’am.

23
00:01:06.793 --> 00:01:13.148
I can’t wait to go out and see the city!

